            <title>[IGNITE-1172] CacheMetricsMBeans are not registered</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1172</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Cache Metrics MBeans are not registered. Need to register this beans when cache created on node.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
